91	
92	    /**
93	     * Maximum number of owners that may be registered in a single day. A create made once this many
94	     * owners already carry today's {@code registrationDate} is rejected with a {@code 429 Too Many
95	     * Requests} (see {@link #rejectDailyRegistrationLimitReached}).
